{
  "movie_id": 520800701,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 6.4,
      "end_time": 8.6,
      "text": "Here! Is that all of it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 9.1,
      "end_time": 11.3,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Lady Isla"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 11.5,
      "end_time": 14.6,
      "text": "Ahaha, when we're in trouble, we help each other♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 15.1,
      "end_time": 18.1,
      "text": "You're the hard worker here, auntie♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 18.4,
      "end_time": 19.3,
      "text": "Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 19.5,
      "end_time": 22.6,
      "text": "My stupid son said he wanted to go to school!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 22.9,
      "end_time": 25.3,
      "text": "Which means I have to work hard!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 26.4,
      "end_time": 29.7,
      "text": "Thanks to you, Lady Isla, I can now dream of the future"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 30.5,
      "end_time": 32.3,
      "text": "...Thank you so much!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 33.3,
      "end_time": 34.6,
      "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 35.0,
      "end_time": 37.2,
      "text": "You're the ones who chose the future!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 37.9,
      "end_time": 39.2,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 39.4,
      "end_time": 41.6,
      "text": "Lady Isla! Would you like to join us?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 42.0,
      "end_time": 43.0,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 44.5,
      "end_time": 47.9,
      "text": "Sorry, I have an important promise to fulfill after this!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 48.1,
      "end_time": 49.3,
      "text": "Oh! I see, I see!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 49.6,
      "end_time": 50.8,
      "text": "See you later, Auntie!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 56.4,
      "end_time": 58.4,
      "text": "Ugh... S-So cold...!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 58.9,
      "end_time": 60.3,
      "text": "Whining already?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 61.6,
      "end_time": 64.3,
      "text": "You are the ones who asked me to train you"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 64.6,
      "end_time": 66.6,
      "text": "Y-Yes, Lady Shinatsu!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 66.8,
      "end_time": 68.9,
      "text": "We want to become stronger...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 69.2,
      "end_time": 72.7,
      "text": "If I'm not strong, I won't be able to protect myself or what's important to me...!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 73.5,
      "end_time": 75.5,
      "text": "Hehe, that is the spirit to have"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 76.1,
      "end_time": 77.2,
      "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 77.6,
      "end_time": 82.0,
      "text": "I apologize, but I have an important promise to fulfill, so I shall be taking my leave here"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 82.7,
      "end_time": 84.4,
      "text": "Make sure not to push yourself too hard, everyone"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 84.7,
      "end_time": 85.6,
      "text": "Yes!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 100.7,
      "end_time": 102.0,
      "text": "...You are late"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 103.2,
      "end_time": 105.3,
      "text": "Ahaha, how picturesque!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 105.8,
      "end_time": 108.0,
      "text": "Is this what they call \"steamy beauties\"?"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 108.3,
      "end_time": 110.7,
      "text": "Sorry, we are an hour late"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 111.2,
      "end_time": 113.6,
      "text": "Ahaha! Make sure to take off your mask!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 113.8,
      "end_time": 116.1,
      "text": "We're going in naked, after all♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 116.5,
      "end_time": 119.8,
      "text": "...I know... but... it is still embarrassing"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 120.4,
      "end_time": 123.1,
      "text": "I should have not proposed to come to a hot spring..."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 123.3,
      "end_time": 124.3,
      "text": "Wait, ah?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start_time": 130.0,
      "end_time": 131.8,
      "text": "L-Let me go..."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start_time": 136.0,
      "end_time": 137.7,
      "text": "...I heard about it"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start_time": 138.3,
      "end_time": 139.9,
      "text": "That you have resolved everything"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start_time": 140.2,
      "end_time": 141.5,
      "text": "How cold!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start_time": 141.9,
      "end_time": 143.8,
      "text": "It was all thanks to you, Eris-chan♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start_time": 144.2,
      "end_time": 145.0,
      "text": "Yes..."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start_time": 145.5,
      "end_time": 149.3,
      "text": "Thanks to you, we were all able to fulfill this promise at the hot springs"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start_time": 150.7,
      "end_time": 153.1,
      "text": "I do not remember ever agreeing..."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start_time": 153.7,
      "end_time": 155.4,
      "text": "But you still came♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start_time": 155.7,
      "end_time": 157.8,
      "text": "Those girls were looking forward to it too, you know?"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start_time": 158.1,
      "end_time": 161.7,
      "text": "Rei and the others said they would be late because of guild business"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start_time": 162.3,
      "end_time": 164.8,
      "text": "Hehe... I'm glad they're keeping themselves busy"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start_time": 165.1,
      "end_time": 167.3,
      "text": "I want to see Hiyori-chan as soon as possible♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start_time": 167.6,
      "end_time": 169.5,
      "text": "And I bet you wanna see, Yui-chan!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start_time": 169.9,
      "end_time": 172.1,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start_time": 172.6,
      "end_time": 175.5,
      "text": "Huh? What's with that expression?"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start_time": 176.0,
      "end_time": 176.7,
      "text": "WAPUU!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start_time": 176.9,
      "end_time": 178.9,
      "text": "Ah! You really did it now, Eris-chan! You meanie!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start_time": 179.2,
      "end_time": 180.9,
      "text": "Are you two kids...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start_time": 181.1,
      "end_time": 182.8,
      "text": "Fuguh?! T-That went into my nose..."
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start_time": 183.0,
      "end_time": 185.6,
      "text": "Ahaha!!"
    }
  ],
